1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:06,330
Bugun kechasi eshigingni ikki mehmon taqillatadi.

2
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,690
Ikkitami? Kim ekan?

3
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:10,976
Birinchisi kichkina.

4
00:00:11,026 --> 00:00:13,061
Boshini egib turibdi.

5
00:00:13,111 --> 00:00:14,550
Qo'lida qog'oz.

6
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:17,770
Kirsin. Mehmon otangdek ulug'.

7
00:00:18,120 --> 00:00:22,690
Qog'ozda yozilgan: mijozga noto'g'ri fayl yubording.

8
00:00:23,040 --> 00:00:24,665
Ha... bo'ladi-da.

9
00:00:24,715 --> 00:00:26,340
Ertaga tuzataman.

10
00:00:26,690 --> 00:00:30,600
Uning orqasidan ikkinchisi keldi.

11
00:00:30,650 --> 00:00:32,160
Katta. Sovuq.

12
00:00:32,210 --> 00:00:35,160
Faqat ostonada turmoqchi.

13
00:00:35,510 --> 00:00:37,020
Tursin. Nima bo'pti?

14
00:00:37,370 --> 00:00:41,860
Endi senga pichirlayapti: «Sen doim shunaqasan.»

15
00:00:42,210 --> 00:00:44,690
Balki rostdir...

16
00:00:45,040 --> 00:00:50,350
Endi to'rga o'tib oldi: «Seni ishdan bo'shatishadi.»

17
00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:51,558
Bo'shatishsa-chi?

18
00:00:51,608 --> 00:00:52,840
Uydagilarga nima deyman?

19
00:00:53,190 --> 00:00:53,595
Tun.

20
00:00:53,645 --> 00:00:58,028
Birinchi mehmon allaqachon uxlab qoldi.

21
00:00:58,078 --> 00:01:01,780
Ikkinchisi esa yostig'ing yonida.

22
00:01:02,130 --> 00:01:04,940
Hoy, bu mening uyim-ku! Ketsin!

23
00:01:05,290 --> 00:01:06,140
Ketmaydi.

24
00:01:06,190 --> 00:01:09,440
Uni o'zing choyga taklif qilding.

25
00:01:09,490 --> 00:01:12,340
Endi u mehmon emas, xo'jayin.

26
00:01:12,690 --> 00:01:14,210
U o'zi kim?

27
00:01:14,560 --> 00:01:18,352
Uning ismi «Men yaramasman».

28
00:01:18,402 --> 00:01:22,880
U doim xatoning orqasidan keladi.

29
00:01:23,230 --> 00:01:25,160
Birinchisi-chi? Xato?

30
00:01:25,510 --> 00:01:27,556
Xato haqiqiy mehmon.

31
00:01:27,606 --> 00:01:31,644
Uni kutib ol: tan ol, uzr so'ra, tuzat.

32
00:01:31,694 --> 00:01:33,740
Ertalab o'zi ketadi.

33
00:01:34,090 --> 00:01:35,200
Ikkinchisi-chi?

34
00:01:35,550 --> 00:01:37,254
Unga uchta savol ber.

35
00:01:37,304 --> 00:01:38,674
Aniq nima bo'ldi?

36
00:01:38,724 --> 00:01:41,180
Nimani o'zim o'ylab topyapman?

37
00:01:41,230 --> 00:01:44,270
Hozir qanday bitta qadam qila olaman?

38
00:01:44,620 --> 00:01:49,560
Rahbarim faqat «faylni qayta yubor» degan edi...

39
00:01:49,910 --> 00:01:52,078
Ana. Fakt shu.

40
00:01:52,128 --> 00:01:55,880
Qolgani mehmonning gapi.

41
00:01:56,230 --> 00:01:59,247
Xato hammaning eshigini taqillatadi.

42
00:01:59,297 --> 00:02:05,210
Uning sherigini ichkariga kiritish-kiritmaslikni esa o'zing tanlaysan.

